## Stream propose-facts agent steps into the workbench spinner
================================================================================

Context: Propose facts showed a static "Proposing…" spinner with no hint of
what the agent was doing (listing classes, searching the graph, validating
patches). Users waited 15–30s on a blank overlay. Stream each agent step over
SSE and render a live checklist under the prompt.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_simulation_facts/engine.py
   Emit thinking / tool_call / tool_result / output events via ``on_event``.
2. src/api/routers/internal/simulation.py
   ``POST /simulation/facts/agent/stream`` SSE; human-readable step labels.
3. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_workbench.html
   Progress list under the fact prompt.
4. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-workbench.js
   Consume the SSE stream and append each step next to the spinner.
5. src/front/static/simulation/css/simulation.css
   Checklist styling with ``--db-*`` tokens.
6. tests/units/agents/test_agent_simulation_facts.py
   Assert ``on_event`` receives thinking, tools, and output.
7. tests/units/simulation/test_simulation_runner_api.py
   Cover step labels, stream SSE, and the builder guard.
8. tests/units/front/test_simulation_page_contract.py
   Require the progress DOM ids and the stream URL.

