   Hide the box on click; stop sending/applying the General-tab description.
4. src/api/routers/internal/simulation.py
   Drop CURRENT DESCRIPTION from the facts user message.
5. src/agents/agent_simulation_facts/engine.py
   System prompt no longer merges a General-tab description.
